From: palapeli OHOS adaptation
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] CMakeLists.txt: make the DocTools handbook pipeline optional

The KF6 documentation tool chain (kdoctools) is not published in the ohpcd
registry at any version, while upstream lists DocTools in the REQUIRED
component set of find_package(KF6 ...) and runs kdoctools_install(po).
The handbook is a documentation-only artifact: dropping it keeps every
runtime feature of the game intact.

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -38,7 +38,6 @@ find_package(KF6 ${KF_MIN_VERSION} REQUIRED COMPONENTS
     CoreAddons
     Crash
     DBusAddons
-    DocTools
     I18n
     ItemViews
     KIO
@@ -62,11 +61,9 @@ add_subdirectory(pics)
 add_subdirectory(src)
 add_subdirectory(mime)
 add_subdirectory(puzzles)
-add_subdirectory(doc)
 
 ecm_qt_install_logging_categories(EXPORT PALAPELI FILE palapeli.categories DESTINATION ${KDE_INSTALL_LOGGINGCATEGORIESDIR})
 
 ki18n_install(po)
-kdoctools_install(po)
 
 feature_summary(WHAT ALL FATAL_ON_MISSING_REQUIRED_PACKAGES)
